3) DEFECTS FOUND
----------------
(a) The wheel packaged only `["src", "src.sources"]`. It omitted
    `third_party/seoextract` (vendored audit engine), `profiles/`, and
    `evals/`. `pip install <wheel> && seo-agent doctor` failed with
    "site profile not found" and "No module named 'seoextract'".
    No real site had been crawled; every pass was fixture-based.
(b) `pipeline.load_profile` did `config.PROFILES_DIR / profile_path`
    where `profile_path` was `profiles/site.json` and
    `config.PROFILES_DIR` is already the profiles dir, producing the
    doubled path `profiles/profiles/site.json`. Only surfaced outside the
    checkout (installed wheel run from any cwd).

