- The pinned-commit guard checks `config.SEOEXTRACT_COMMIT == 6544a74e`
  (the config constant in the wheel) and `seoextract.__version__ == 0.3.0`.
  The vendored `seoextract` carries no embedded commit hash, so this guards
  config-constant integrity, not a byte-level match of the vendored code to
  that commit. `probe_capabilities` additionally verifies the required
  symbols exist. Acceptable guard; not hermetic.

